      "narration": "Quick NCLEX check. A client has severe **anemia**. Which finding should the nurse expect? [pause 2.5] The answer is B. Fewer red blood cells means less oxygen delivery, so the heart speeds up to compensate, and the client feels **fatigued**.",
      "holdSeconds": 0.8,
